        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>RK International AP-PH-4621, Barrel Middle Refrigerator Handle</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe 12 Inch Barrel Middle Door Appliance Pull is available in 6 finishes, all of which really bring out its beauty. Choose from distressed nickel, satin nickel, polished nickel, antique english, distressed copper and oil rubbed bronze finishes. The Barrel Middle Refrigerator Handle is great for modern styled kitchens since it looks sleek yet homey. It has 12 inch center to centers. This refrigerator pull is also great for other appliances in the kitchen. It comes packaged with all the necessary mounting hardware.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available Matching <a href=\"/products/barrel-middle-cabinet-pull-rk-international-cp-807\"><b>Barrel Middle Cabinet Pull</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the AP-PH-4621 Traditional Barrel Middle Door Handle:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Length c.c. (center to center): 12\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Length: 13\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 1-1/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Packaged with mounting screws for a refrigerator/appliance door panel.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/MUL-T-LOCK-TSR25_size.gif?v=1704354575\" width=\"600\" height=\"133\" border=\"0\" alt=\"RKI Finishes Diagram\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
